screens-settings-decision-making-agent-judges-place-place = The Decision-Making Agent: the third core agent, the one that judges in place of a place's own rule, at eleven places across the platform — which model leads and how hard it works, who picks up a work item, whether a call is safe, and more. Who answers for it is set here. Off by default; its judgement never signs a gate.
