screens-settings-flutter-apps-ios-simulator-android-emulator = Flutter apps on the iOS Simulator, an Android emulator or a phone, beside the code in the Project IDE: whether it is on here and for which platforms, what is installed and how to install the rest, the devices, who may drive them, and the paths this machine uses. Off until you turn it on.
