screens-settings-people-other-nodes-whether-message-from = People on other nodes: whether a message from one is read by the classifier before an agent hears it, and whether an agent woken by one may use a tool beyond reading without asking you first.
screens-settings-people-other-nodes-workspace-hosts-each = The people on other nodes this workspace hosts, each at a role; the invitations that bring them; the workspaces you are a guest of. Everyone joins as a human only, and reaches what their role allows.
screens-settings-performance = Performance
screens-settings-pet = Pet
