screens-settings-relays-transport-never-authority-they-see = Relays are transport, never authority: they see ciphertext and a recipient. A workspace with none still works; these are how people on other nodes reach it.
screens-settings-security = Security
screens-settings-settings-sections = Settings sections
screens-settings-shell-font-scrollback-which-harness-place = The shell, its font, its scrollback, and which harness a place opens by default.
screens-settings-six-independent-dials-theme-accent-density = Six independent dials — theme, accent, density, text size and the two faces. They compose, so nobody had to author the combination you end up with.
